{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">TVB《非份之罪》熱播，由吳偉豪擔正的單元四《危險遊戲》獲網民一致好評，指追看性十足。日前一眾演員現身街頭為劇集宣傳造勢，吸引大批市民圍觀，有幸運網民更在社交平台興奮分享當天與吳偉豪近距離互動的過程，直呼被其暖心舉動徹底融化。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">該網民透露，當天吳偉豪以一頭清爽短髮造型亮相，精神奕奕且充滿活力。活動期間他毫無明星架子，化身「行走的表情包」對著群眾和鏡頭不斷做出各種調皮鬼馬的表情，讓粉絲拿著相機狂拍也幾乎快抓拍不及。最令粉絲驚喜的是，當該粉絲將手機遞給吳偉豪時，他竟主動走向身後的宣傳背景板「給自己加戲」，將頭貼近海報上自己飾演的角色「危家仁」身旁，一邊用手指鏡頭一邊擘大口，模仿海報中角色猙獰又憤怒的表情，與背後劇照幾乎一模一樣，喜感十足且毫無偶像包袱。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"efc7c3ad-ee91-4602-bd71-2aea9eedd50d.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026ozW739N4bM1784776336.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"efc7c3ad-ee91-4602-bd71-2aea9eedd50d.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c6d85870-8ff1-4a36-8d9d-ab97a3352f04.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026VJVVSjKBtc1784776340.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c6d85870-8ff1-4a36-8d9d-ab97a3352f04.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">該粉絲笑指吳偉豪擺出此表情是否怕大家不知「危家仁」在劇中有多壞，而雙方對話中，吳偉豪也透露自己以前在幕前從未試過飾演如此「衰格」的角色。雖然戲裡角色讓人恨之入骨，但戲外的吳偉豪卻是不折不扣的暖男，當天不僅落力拿起大聲公叫喊宣傳、大方展示親筆簽名宣傳照，對粉絲的要求更是來者不拒、耐心滿足大家的願望。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-23T11:20:11.810636+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":478,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}